{"dossier":"D07","entry_points":[{"sids":["arch/x86/kvm/svm/svm.c::svm_hardware_setup","arch/x86/kvm/svm/svm.c::__initdata.alt_2","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_exit","arch/x86/kvm/svm/svm.c::svm_exit"],"text":"SVM entry chains vendor and generic with device last; hardware runs once for paging, interrupts, counters, caps; global exit reverses device, virt, debug, masks, caches, gmem, VFIO, async, irqfd."},{"sids":["arch/x86/kvm/x86.c::kvm_timer_init","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_init_virtualization.alt_1","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_uninit_virtualization.alt_1","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_init_virtualization.alt_2","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_uninit_virtualization.alt_2","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_enable_virtualization.alt_2","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_init_debug","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_stats_debugfs_mode"],"text":"Clock acts only without invariant TSC with hooks; virt honors load flag with no-op alternate; debug publishes VM and VCPU stats under KVM with descriptor mode."}],"exports":[{"sids":["arch/x86/kvm/x86.c::kvm_x86_vendor_init","arch/x86/kvm/x86.c::kvm_x86_vendor_exit"],"text":"Vendor init consumes bundle and returns status; exit releases perf, APIC, clocks, hardware, MSRs, MMU, cache and clears hook."},{"sids":["virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_init","virt/kvm/guest_memfd.c::kvm_gmem_init","virt/kvm/guest_memfd.h::kvm_gmem_init","virt/kvm/guest_memfd.c::kvm_gmem_exit","virt/kvm/guest_memfd.h::kvm_gmem_exit","virt/kvm/eventfd.c::kvm_irqfd_init","virt/kvm/eventfd.c::kvm_irqfd_exit","virt/kvm/async_pf.c::kvm_async_pf_init","virt/kvm/async_pf.c::kvm_async_pf_deinit"],"text":"Generic bringup creates caches, masks, irqfd, async fault, sched, debug, gmem then enables virt and device last; gmem, irqfd, async provide paired init and exit."},{"sids":["virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::__kvm_register_perf_callbacks","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_unregister_perf_callbacks","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_register_device_ops","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_unregister_device_ops","virt/kvm/vfio.c::kvm_vfio_ops_init","v