r restore, realtime without invariant TSC, PAT0 low bits not 6, or unexpected shadow stack; TSC uses 32 bit fraction, ratio one, bounded frequency."},{"sids":["arch/x86/kvm/svm/svm.c::svm_hardware_setup","arch/x86/kvm/svm/svm.c::svm_set_cpu_caps","arch/x86/kvm/x86.c::kvm_setup_xss_caps","arch/x86/kvm/x86.c::kvm_setup_efer_caps","arch/x86/kvm/svm/svm.h::sev_set_cpu_caps","arch/x86/kvm/svm/svm.h::sev_hardware_setup"],"text":"SVM needs non-execute then degrades optionals; caps build from generic base with gated nesting and encryption, cleared bits, seeded quirks, nulled AVIC or NMI when unavailable."},{"sids":["arch/x86/kvm/svm/svm.c::svm_adjust_mmio_mask"],"text":"MMIO mask unchanged without extended CPUID or encryption; else host width selects mask below 52 with 51 upper and clears above, keyed on 0x80000000, 0x8000001F and SYSCFG."},{"sids":["arch/x86/kvm/x86.c::kvm_alloc_emulator_cache","arch/x86/kvm/x86.h::KVM_SANITY_CHECK_VM_STRUCT_SIZE","arch/x86/kvm/svm/svm.c::svm_init"],"text":"Emulation cache is accounted slab with user copy from operands to end; VM order stays small unless debug aids on."},{"sids":["virt/kvm/guest_memfd.c::kvm_gmem_init","virt/kvm/guest_memfd.c::kvm_gmem_init_mount","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_arch_enable_virtualization","virt/kvm/kvm_main.c::kvm_stats_debugfs_mode","arch/x86/kvm/svm/svm_onhyperv.c::svm_hv_enable_l2_tlb_flush"],"text":"Guest mount uses dedicated fs, marks noexec, unwinds cache on failure; arch enable is no-op; stats 0444 instant else 0644; L2 flush fails OOM on bad assist."},{"sids":["arch/x86/kvm/vmx/capabilities.h::cpu_has_vmx_basic_inout","arch/x86/kvm/vmx/capabilities.h::cpu_has_vmx_basic_no_hw_errcode_cc","arch/x86/kvm/vmx/capabilities.h::cpu_has_virtual_nmis","arch/x86/kvm/vmx/capabilities.h::cpu_has_vmx_preemption_timer","arch/x86/kvm/vmx/capabilities.h::cpu_has_vmx_posted_intr","arch/x86/kvm/vmx/capabilities.h::cpu_has_load_ia32_efer","arch/x86/kvm/vmx/capabilities.h::cpu_has_load_perf_global_ctrl","arch/x86/kvm/vmx/ca